Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:39:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Move a loop-local name out with a bare break

break x of an owning name declared in the loop moves it, as return x does, before the jump runs the defers of the scopes it leaves (Core sentence 1); an outer name still takes <x. Held: the reference oracle does not model it yet (its hard gate fires on r3-s36-reads-t02_break_bare and this test).
